  - `gh` → https://api.github.com; env GH_HOST, GH_TOKEN; https://api.github.com/ is routed through Jam
  Egress (other hosts are blocked): github.com, npmjs.org, pkg.go.dev, plus the sealed base and Jam's own routes.

